   <indicator ascending="0" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output Indicator</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.# health units reconstructed or rehabilitated using &#x2018;build-back better&#x2019; construction standards
2.# educational establishments reconstructed or rehabilitated using &#x2018;build-back better&#x2019; construction standards
3.# of service users that benefit from rehabilitated/ reconstructed health facilities (men and women; girls and boys)
4.# of school-age children that benefit from reconstructed or rehabilitated educational facilities
5.# tones of municipal solid waste sustainably disposed of and/or recycled per day, using rehabilitated facilities and newly introduced waste management systems
1.6	# of cubic meters of earthquake and tsunami debris recycled by municipal public facilities by the end of the project</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline year="2018">
     <comment>
      <narrative xml:lang="EN">Heavily damaged buildings by the earthquake and government assessment damage and losses have deemed the building as unsafe and unsuitable for use. Hence, we have defined the buildings as zero although there was a building on the site before the earthquake.</narrative>
     </comment>
    </baseline>
